<title>SOUTH KOREA: TABLE - S.Korean retail petrol prices edge down.</title>
<headline>TABLE - S.Korean retail petrol prices edge down.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Petrol prices at South Korean pumps edged lower on average for July sales, the Ministry of Trade, Industry and Energy said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>(price relate to average forecourt prices, in Korean won per litre)</p>
<p>			    July	June</p>
<p>Yukong		   813.50    822.81</p>
<p>LG-Caltex		814.39    825.94</p>
<p>Hanwha		   815.00    824.19</p>
<p>Ssangyong		819.12    823.98</p>
<p>Hyundai		  814.05    823.98</p>
<p>AVERAGE		  814.67    824.11</p>
<p>($1.00 = 888 won)</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
</text>
